The Honest Risk
SA-SAMS version fragmentation: Different provinces run slightly different SA-SAMS versions. Your agent might need tweaks per province. Mitigate: start in Free State only, nail one version, then expand.
School buying cycles: Principals decide in November/December for the following year. If you miss this window, you wait a year. Get 3–5 pilots running this term so you have proof points for January sign-ups.
WhatsApp API costs: Meta charges per conversation (~R0.30–R0.80). Build this into your pricing or cap messages per tier.
